---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Noemium is an open catalog for picking AI tools without getting played. Every recommendation is a public PR."
>
  <SectionHeader
    title="About"
    sub="Pick AI tools without getting played. The catalog is the repo. The repo is the product."
  />

  <article class="nm-card max-w-2xl space-y-5 p-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed md:p-8">
    <p>
      I'm Vladimir. I got tired of “best AI tools” lists that read like invoices. Noemium is the
      opposite: an open catalog of tools, stacks and models I actually run, with named
      limitations and a date on every number.
    </p>
    <p>
      The rule: no source, no number. If we print a price or a claim, it needs a receipt —
      a pricing page when we can get one, at least one primary link when we can't. Homepages
      still show; they don't pretend to be invoices.
    </p>
    <p>
      A pull request is the product. Every card is a YAML file. Wrong price? Open a PR. Paid
      placements in rankings: never — we publish every declined offer in the
      <a href="/refusals/" class="text-accent hover:underline">Open Refusal Ledger</a>. Affiliate
      links exist, are declared in the data file, and fail CI if they sneak in elsewhere.
    </p>
    <p>
      There are no star ratings. Stars on nine reviews are a costume. We print ship /
      situational / skip, what the tool can't do, and the git history behind the card.
    </p>
    <p>
      That's the whole pitch. Fork it, break a number, send the receipt.
    </p>
    <p class="font-mono text-[13px] text-ink-dim">
      <a href="/method/" class="text-accent hover:underline">How we grade →</a>
      <span class="mx-2" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <a href="/why/" class="text-accent hover:underline">Why directories lie</a>
      <span class="mx-2" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <a href="/contribute/" class="text-accent hover:underline">Contribute</a>
      <span class="mx-2" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <a href="https://github.com/SaneSanders/noemium" class="text-accent hover:underline" rel="noopener">
        GitHub
      </a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
